                                        <strong>Withholding tax certificate</strong>
                                    </h3>
                                </span>
                                <span class="text-center">
                                    <h4>
                                        According to Section 50 Bis of the Revenue Code
                                    </h4>
                                </span>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <span>เล่มที่</span>
                                <br/>
                                <span>
                                    <b>No.
